# Go conventions

- Layout: `cmd/{server,agent,shardman}`, `internal/{period,fsm,store,resolve,api,seal,retention,metrics}`.
- Domain logic in `internal/period` and `internal/fsm` — no chi/pgx imports there.
- HTTP: chi; DB: pgx; logs: slog; metrics: Prometheus client.
- Config via env (`METADATA_PG_DSN`, `CLUSTER_KEY`, `SEAL_CHECK_INTERVAL`).
- Admin/internal auth: `X-Cluster-Key` header only.
- Integration tests: build tag `integration`, env `METADATA_PG_DSN`.
